  "body": "This is the new method mentioned in #36.\r\nAt this point, we have implemented the conversion of the cost function from a docplex model to the PUBO representation. We will be updating the inequality constraint and the equality constraints soon.\r\n\r\n\r\n``` python\r\nfrom docplex.mp.model import Model\r\n\r\nfrom openqaoa.problems.helper_functions import docplex2qubo\r\n\r\nmdl = Model(\"Test\") # Docplex model\r\nnum_z = 5 # Number of variables\r\nz = mdl.binary_var_list(num_z, name=\"Z\")\r\n\r\n\r\nobjective = mdl.sum(z) - 2 * z[0]  + z[3] * z[4] + 5\r\n\r\nmdl.minimize(objective)\r\n\r\nsol = mdl.solve()\r\n\r\nmdl.print_solution(print_zeros=True)\r\n\r\nqubo_problem = docplex2qubo(mdl)\r\n\r\nisingOQ = qubo_problem.qubo_to_ising()\r\n\r\nfrom openqaoa.workflows.optimizer import QAOA  \r\nq = QAOA()\r\nq.compile(qubo_problem)\r\nq.optimize() \r\nprint(q.results_information[\"best probability\"])\r\n\r\n```",
